  "method": "Three samples per 4-session typing mode, 10 waves of 3000 edits per session (120000 edits/sample), 5ms injected write delay, 0 or 12 observers. New store per sample; no excluded warm-up, later samples warm filesystem/JIT. Shared writes: four real child processes x100 atomic transactions over 500 retained rows. Interruption: kill owned child after acknowledged save and before replacement rename, then wait 31s for its renewable lock to expire. Tracked repository: 10000 files, 6000-line source, 2.5MB diff, 1MiB binary image, three cold/warm gathers. Fixture creation excluded. Timings are observations, no performance thresholds; memory endpoints are parent process only, not peaks or child/browser totals.",
